  <section class="section faq" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title" data-glyde-faq>
    <header class="sectionHeading centerHeading">
      <p>FAQ</p>
      <h2 id="faq-title">Questions You Might Have.</h2>
    </header>
    <div class="faqList">
      <article class="faqItem" data-glyde-faq-item>
        <h3>
          <button id="faq-price-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="answer-price" data-glyde-faq-button>
            <span>How much does GLYDE cost?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div id="answer-price" class="faqAnswer" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-price-toggle" aria-hidden="true" data-glyde-faq-answer>
          <p>GLYDE retails at $219. But when you reserve now for just $3, you lock in an exclusive $80 discount — bringing your final price down to $139. That's less than 5 barbershop visits, and you'll have it for life.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="faqItem" data-glyde-faq-item>
        <h3>
          <button id="faq-reservation-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="answer-reservation" data-glyde-faq-button>
            <span>What's included in the $3 reservation?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div id="answer-reservation" class="faqAnswer" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-reservation-toggle" aria-hidden="true" data-glyde-faq-answer>
          <p>Your $3 secures your spot for early access and an exclusive $80 off the retail price ($219 down to $139), plus priority shipping and dedicated support. The $3 is applied as a credit toward your final purchase. If you change your mind, it's fully refundable anytime before launch.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="faqItem" data-glyde-faq-item>
        <h3>
          <button id="faq-beginner-friendly-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="answer-beginner-friendly" data-glyde-faq-button>
            <span>Is GLYDE really beginner-friendly?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div id="answer-beginner-friendly" class="faqAnswer" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-beginner-friendly-toggle" aria-hidden="true" data-glyde-faq-answer>
          <p>Absolutely. GLYDE is designed for people who've never picked up clippers before. The app walks you through every step — where to start, which direction to move, how long to cut. The auto-fade technology handles the blending for you, so you don't need any barber skills.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="faqItem" data-glyde-faq-item>
        <h3>
          <button id="faq-mistake-prevention-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="answer-mistake-prevention" data-glyde-faq-button>
            <span>What if I mess up while cutting?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div id="answer-mistake-prevention" class="faqAnswer" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-mistake-prevention-toggle" aria-hidden="true" data-glyde-faq-answer>
          <p>GLYDE is built to prevent that. If you move too fast, the blade automatically retracts. If the angle is off, it compensates in real time. The system is designed to make mistakes nearly impossible — even on your first try.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="faqItem" data-glyde-faq-item>
        <h3>
          <button id="faq-hair-types-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="answer-hair-types" data-glyde-faq-button>
            <span>Does it work for all hair types?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div id="answer-hair-types" class="faqAnswer" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-hair-types-toggle" aria-hidden="true" data-glyde-faq-answer>
          <p>GLYDE is optimized for head hair and works across a range of hair types and textures. The smart blade adapts to different densities, and the app includes styles tested across various head shapes.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="faqItem" data-glyde-faq-item>
        <h3>
          <button id="faq-shipping-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="answer-shipping" data-glyde-faq-button>
            <span>When will GLYDE ship?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div id="answer-shipping" class="faqAnswer" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-shipping-toggle" aria-hidden="true" data-glyde-faq-answer>
          <p>We expect to begin shipping in October 2026. Reserve holders will receive exact shipping dates and updates via email as we approach launch.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="finalCta" aria-labelledby="final-title">
    <header class="sectionHeading centerHeading">
      <p>Join the waitlist</p>
      <h2 id="final-title">Ready For Your First <em>Perfect Fade?</em></h2>
    </header>
    <p class="finalLead">Join The Waitlist Now. Early Subscribers Save $80 At Launch.</p>
    <div class="formShell footerFormShell">
      {% assign footer_form_success = false %}
      {% assign footer_form_has_errors = false %}
      {% form 'customer', id: 'glyde-footer-waitlist', class: 'waitlistForm', return_to: '/#glyde-footer-waitlist', data-shopify-captcha: 'true' %}
        {% if form.posted_successfully? %}
          {% assign footer_form_success = true %}
        {% endif %}
        {% if form.errors %}
          {% assign footer_form_has_errors = true %}
        {% endif %}
        <input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="newsletter,GLYDE Landing Page">
        <label class="srOnly" for="footer-email">Email address</label>
        <input
          id="footer-email"
          name="contact[email]"
          type="email"
          inputmode="email"
          autocomplete="email"
          placeholder="GLYDE@163.com"
          value="{{ form.email | escape }}"
          required
          aria-invalid="{% if form.errors %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
          aria-describedby="footer-form-status"
        >
        <span aria-hidden="true" class="formDivider"></span>
        <button type="submit">Get Early Access</button>
      {% endform %}
      <p
        id="footer-form-status"
        class="formStatus{% if footer_form_has_errors %} formError{% endif %}"
        aria-live="polite"
      >
        {% if footer_form_success %}
          You're on the list. Watch your inbox for GLYDE updates.
        {% elsif footer_form_has_errors %}
          Please enter a valid email address and try again.
        {% endif %}
      </p>
    </div>
    <ul class="finalTrust" aria-label="Reservation benefits">
      <li>Secure checkout</li><li>Early backer pricing</li><li>Priority support</li>
    </ul>
    <nav class="socialLinks" aria-label="Social media">
      <a href="https://www.facebook.com/GLYDEsmartclipper" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="GLYDE on Facebook">
        <img src="{{ 'social-facebook.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="100" height="100" loading="lazy">
      </a>
      <a href="https://www.instagram.com/glyde_smartclipper/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="GLYDE on Instagram">
        <img src="{{ 'social-instagram.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="100" height="100" loading="lazy">
      </a>
      <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@smarthairclipper" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="GLYDE on YouTube">
        <img src="{{ 'social-youtube.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="100" height="100" loading="lazy">
      </a>
      <span class="socialUnavailable" role="img" aria-label="GLYDE on X — profile coming soon">
        <img src="{{ 'social-x.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="100" height="100" loading="lazy">
      </span>
    </nav>
    <footer class="footer">
      <p>© 2026 GLYDE By Kuaiku Innovation. All Rights Reserved.</p>
      <nav aria-label="Legal">
        <a href="/policies/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="/policies/terms-of-service">Terms of Service</a>
        <a href="mailto:timchen@smarthairclipper.com">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </footer>
  </section>
</div>

